WEBVTT

00:02.475 --> 00:03.942
Legend has it...

00:05.111 --> 00:07.909
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.247 --> 00:13.412
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.054 --> 00:20.014
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.372 --> 00:40.801
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.047 --> 00:46.917
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.454 --> 00:54.359
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.028 --> 00:59.794
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.899 --> 01:03.096
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.873 --> 01:13.938
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.113 --> 01:19.949
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:20.820 --> 01:28.090
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.294 --> 01:36.668
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.370 --> 01:39.031
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.781 --> 01:52.182
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:59.225 --> 02:00.055
They'll kill you!

02:13.806 --> 02:16.434
That's about two mon, wouldn't you say?

02:18.945 --> 02:23.905
<i>A Fighter Without Peer</i>

02:42.568 --> 02:46.595
I don't know what this Mutsu business
is, but if he's that powerful...

02:46.872 --> 02:48.237
...then let me kill him!

02:48.975 --> 02:50.033
No, you mustn't.

02:50.943 --> 02:54.640
Even the great Musashi is no
match for him, that much I know.

02:55.081 --> 02:59.074
But I'm the man they hired
to kill the great Musashi!

02:59.318 --> 03:02.412
I've heard that those who secretly
kill enemies of the Yagyu Style...

03:02.688 --> 03:05.213
...are called the Ura-Yagyu...

03:05.524 --> 03:09.688
A Yagyu bearing an "Ura" before
his name exists only in the shadows...

03:10.162 --> 03:13.825
The only way to emerge from those
shadows is to kill the powerful, and...

03:14.000 --> 03:16.264
...thus win acknowledgement
from the clan elders...

03:18.004 --> 03:19.471
Musashi or not...

03:19.572 --> 03:22.973
...anyone who confronts the Yagyu
Shinkage, mentors to the Shogun...

03:23.109 --> 03:25.077
...is asking for sure death!

03:43.129 --> 03:45.359
You're very powerful, young man...

03:45.598 --> 03:46.394
However...

03:46.532 --> 03:50.662
...sometimes in this world, it is
unacceptable to wield such power.

03:53.406 --> 03:54.930
I'll have to kill you...

04:00.346 --> 04:01.813
That Lord Yagyu...

04:02.515 --> 04:04.244
...is certainly powerful...

04:12.858 --> 04:15.793
What is this feeling?

04:16.662 --> 04:18.721
I've never felt anything this strong!

04:21.667 --> 04:22.725
Run!

04:23.069 --> 04:26.197
That's enough, this time
you'll be killed for sure!

04:26.772 --> 04:29.332
But I haven't done my five
mon's worth of work yet.

04:30.643 --> 04:34.340
I've still got three mon to go.

04:38.584 --> 04:41.280
So, he's going to draw?

04:41.554 --> 04:43.681
Trying for an Iaido move?

04:49.428 --> 04:50.622
That kid!

04:51.230 --> 04:52.959
You fool, do you want to die?

04:54.200 --> 04:54.928
I knew it...

04:55.501 --> 04:56.195
Mutsu...

04:59.505 --> 05:00.494
Let's do it, shall we?

05:01.107 --> 05:03.302
Now I see, kenpo, huh?

05:04.310 --> 05:05.072
But still...

05:06.145 --> 05:08.477
Do you really think
you can beat me unarmed?

05:21.594 --> 05:22.583
It's no good...

05:23.662 --> 05:24.993
No good!

05:25.731 --> 05:26.595
Stop it!

05:31.137 --> 05:32.502
Shirahadori?

05:32.638 --> 05:33.662
No way!

05:43.015 --> 05:44.312
He's dead.

05:52.625 --> 05:53.717
Impossible...

05:54.727 --> 05:56.524
Did you know your blade was so dull?

06:03.569 --> 06:07.733
He waited until the last
moment to reverse the blade...

06:09.542 --> 06:12.067
...and slam it to the ground...

06:14.547 --> 06:16.105
Astounding!

06:20.286 --> 06:21.514
This is interesting.

06:24.056 --> 06:26.115
He beat him?

06:27.326 --> 06:28.486
This is fun!

06:34.834 --> 06:36.199
Nice dodge!

06:36.702 --> 06:39.136
Only a master of kenpo
could've pulled that off.

06:39.839 --> 06:41.966
But you shouldn't have
let me grab you like this.

06:42.341 --> 06:45.367
Your skills are of no use at this distance.

06:47.680 --> 06:53.516
The Ura-Yagyus have a grappling
technique based on muto-dori...

06:55.454 --> 06:58.855
In the name of Ura-Yagyu,
no, Hyoma Yagyu!

06:59.291 --> 07:00.315
Prepare yourself!

07:08.834 --> 07:11.234
What the hell, how did this happen?

07:11.904 --> 07:15.499
A throw like that's not
going to kill anyone.

07:16.108 --> 07:19.168
Who the hell is this man?

07:32.291 --> 07:35.783
Mutsu Enmei Style, Ikazuchi!

07:37.296 --> 07:38.593
He won?

07:40.733 --> 07:41.995
That should be five mon...

07:42.902 --> 07:47.532
Now that was a true killing
technique, Mutsu Enmei Style...

07:48.374 --> 07:50.535
Mutsu Enmei Style, eh?

07:52.611 --> 07:54.044
Very interesting!

07:54.813 --> 07:56.747
C-Can't move!

07:58.851 --> 08:00.785
So this is Musashi...

08:01.520 --> 08:05.786
Why don't you tell me all
about this Mutsu Enmei Style...

08:06.458 --> 08:09.120
All I know is from
the legends I've heard.

08:09.561 --> 08:12.587
They perfected the Mute art of
killing with their bare hands...

08:12.731 --> 08:14.631
It's a mythical martial art...

08:15.034 --> 08:16.433
Mute, eh?

08:17.736 --> 08:20.899
And in the hundreds of years
since this art was first used...

08:21.473 --> 08:24.704
...they say that it has
never been defeated.

08:27.112 --> 08:29.012
Not once, I see...

08:30.816 --> 08:32.078
Young Master!

08:32.918 --> 08:33.885
Jii!

08:34.920 --> 08:36.285
Y-You're safe!

08:40.826 --> 08:42.453
Never mind me, what about you?

08:42.695 --> 08:44.185
Oh, it's nothing, really...

08:50.536 --> 08:54.267
When I heard that you'd run off,
I thought you might've come here...

08:56.108 --> 08:58.599
It was Yakumo who saved my life.

08:59.011 --> 08:59.978
Huh?

09:00.546 --> 09:02.776
You mean that man saved you?

09:05.317 --> 09:06.181
So long, then!

09:08.387 --> 09:10.582
That scary guy's here, so I'm escaping.

09:16.261 --> 09:20.163
Little squirt, I'm looking
forward to our next meeting.

09:28.207 --> 09:29.299
Where are you going?

09:32.378 --> 09:33.504
Let me see...

09:34.713 --> 09:36.544
Why don't you ask the wind?

09:38.250 --> 09:40.878
Since my name is Yakumo...

09:42.221 --> 09:45.679
Just like the clouds, I
go where the wind goes.

09:46.792 --> 09:48.817
See you later, Princess!

09:50.029 --> 09:50.859
Yakumo...

09:52.297 --> 09:53.229
Yakumo!

09:54.533 --> 09:55.329
Princess!

09:57.236 --> 09:59.136
I mean, Young Master...

10:00.773 --> 10:02.172
You can call me Princess.

10:03.242 --> 10:07.770
Father, Mother, please forgive me.

10:08.447 --> 10:11.439
I'm just a girl, after all.

10:14.286 --> 10:15.184
Yakumo!

10:16.422 --> 10:19.220
My real name is Shiori...

10:20.359 --> 10:22.759
Let me go with you...

10:23.929 --> 10:24.861
Hell, no...

10:25.264 --> 10:28.461
You won't be needing a
bodyguard if you're a girl again.

10:30.836 --> 10:33.270
You'll make a fine woman for sure.

10:35.974 --> 10:37.032
Take care of yourself.

10:37.609 --> 10:39.167
I won't forget your name!

11:03.035 --> 11:05.560
Ah, what a fine day!

11:08.273 --> 11:09.672
Yakumo Mutsu...

11:10.008 --> 11:12.738
I'm glad you stopped
me on my way to Edo...

11:13.979 --> 11:19.212
Still, there's someone else I have
to defeat before I take him on!

11:20.252 --> 11:24.712
The Swordsmanship Instructor
of the Shogun, Munenori Yagyu...

11:25.657 --> 11:29.753
Master of the Yagyu Shinkage Style,
Leader of the Edo Yagyus!

11:29.862 --> 11:32.695
The man who reigns as Japan's
premier martial artist...

12:00.759 --> 12:02.727
You're thinking of that Mutsu person...

12:07.399 --> 12:10.596
I wonder where he
could be traveling now?

12:12.971 --> 12:15.667
There's no way to know.

12:16.642 --> 12:19.611
Because he's a cloud...

12:51.843 --> 12:53.037
Master...

12:53.712 --> 12:54.974
What is it?

12:55.180 --> 12:55.781
<i>Yagyu Shinkage Style</i>

12:55.781 --> 12:58.113
<i>Someone wishes to challenge you...
Yagyu Shinkage Style</i>

12:58.317 --> 13:01.309
He says his name is Musashi Miyamoto...

13:01.453 --> 13:04.445
And he wants to challenge you to a duel.

13:04.590 --> 13:06.182
I knew he'd be coming...

13:06.358 --> 13:11.091
If by any chance I should lose to
the villainous sword of Musashi...

13:11.430 --> 13:14.558
...the reputation of the Yagyu
Shinkage Style would be ruined.

13:14.766 --> 13:18.361
All that I have striven so hard
to achieve, my rank, my honor...

13:18.470 --> 13:20.404
All would be lost.

13:21.173 --> 13:23.835
Under no circumstances will
I cross swords with Musashi.

13:24.243 --> 13:26.143
I must not cross swords with him!

13:27.246 --> 13:29.908
The Yagyu Shinkage Style
is the Shogun's Style.

13:30.148 --> 13:32.343
We acknowledge your status
as a master swordsman...

13:32.451 --> 13:34.510
...but we cannot accept a
challenge from an outside Style.

13:35.153 --> 13:37.280
In that case, I will do what I must...

13:37.389 --> 13:38.981
Now, now, hold on a minute there.

13:44.062 --> 13:45.689
It's been a while.

13:46.031 --> 13:48.397
You haven't changed. Still the hothead!

13:48.533 --> 13:50.797
Just like an unsheathed blade!

13:50.936 --> 13:53.097
But you're going after the
wrong opponent this time.

13:53.472 --> 13:55.565
You're just dying to
take him on, aren't you?

13:55.774 --> 14:01.872
But why not meet him first, so
you'll know what kind of man he is?

14:02.381 --> 14:06.841
"Musashi Miyamoto wishes to discuss
the art of war with the Master..."

14:07.019 --> 14:09.180
Please give that message to Munenori.

14:09.321 --> 14:10.049
What?

14:10.355 --> 14:12.846
How dare you address the
Master in such a familiar way!

14:13.158 --> 14:14.887
Oh, don't be such a stiff.

14:14.993 --> 14:18.156
Just tell him that the message is
from Takuan, everything will be fine.

14:18.597 --> 14:19.586
Takuan?

14:19.698 --> 14:23.794
Y-You mean you're Takuan Soho,
the Chief Priest of Daitokuji?

14:24.136 --> 14:25.501
Yes, that's me.

14:25.704 --> 14:28.434
I've been friends with
Munenori for a long time.

14:28.640 --> 14:30.437
I-I had no idea...

14:30.542 --> 14:31.941
Please, forgive me...

14:34.279 --> 14:37.305
Takuan, I see you've
risen in the world...

14:37.449 --> 14:39.508
Well, not as much as you...

14:39.584 --> 14:41.984
<i>Swordsmanship and Zen</i>

14:42.287 --> 14:46.986
If it's the Chief Priest of Daitokuji's
wish, then I can't avoid meeting him.

14:48.527 --> 14:50.358
Bring my highest-ranking
disciples here!

15:06.545 --> 15:10.914
Well, Lord Musashi, please tell me
what rank you've achieved in kenjutsu...

15:11.016 --> 15:12.677
As fast as lightning...

15:13.352 --> 15:16.219
I believe that you should
undergo some more training...

15:16.588 --> 15:21.355
Then tell me, Lord Tajima,
what have you learned?

15:21.560 --> 15:24.154
The spring wind blows on the surface...

15:24.262 --> 15:28.460
To elucidate, the art of
using two swords still leaves...

15:28.633 --> 15:31.659
...only one man to lose, and one to win...

15:32.037 --> 15:34.733
Therefore, this is an insignificant art...

15:37.175 --> 15:38.904
I will be taking my leave now.

15:53.458 --> 15:55.790
Is this the son of Lord Tajima?

15:56.128 --> 15:58.460
Correct, that is Master Shichiro.

16:02.367 --> 16:03.925
Well, how did it go?

16:04.102 --> 16:06.127
Did you find Munenori inept?

16:06.238 --> 16:11.107
He's strong, but his power is
not quite what I'm looking for.

16:11.243 --> 16:12.141
I see...

16:12.711 --> 16:17.341
I can tell that he's turning toward
politics, rather than the art of war.

16:17.582 --> 16:19.846
I thought you were
planning to defeat Munenori...

16:19.951 --> 16:22.511
...and take over as
instructor to the Shogun...

16:22.754 --> 16:25.314
It all seems so meaningless now!

16:27.859 --> 16:29.224
Then where are you headed now?

16:29.795 --> 16:33.026
Searching for worthy opponents,
just as I've been doing until now.

16:33.665 --> 16:37.533
If I seek out the powerful, then
I'll be sure to run into that one.

16:38.303 --> 16:39.361
That one?

16:40.172 --> 16:41.139
Yakumo...

16:41.640 --> 16:43.198
Yakumo Mutsu.

16:44.342 --> 16:46.105
I'm sure that he won't let me down...

16:46.845 --> 16:49.609
A man worthy of such
respect from Musashi?

16:49.815 --> 16:52.784
I'd like to meet him myself!

16:53.685 --> 16:57.485
Listen to me, you are not to
let Musashi leave Edo alive!

16:57.689 --> 17:02.126
If we allow him to survive,
we'll have the devil to pay!

17:04.196 --> 17:06.130
I, Hayato Ooseto and...

17:06.531 --> 17:07.589
Tsujikaze!

17:07.699 --> 17:08.495
Yes.

17:10.035 --> 17:12.003
We will stake our lives on this!

17:23.114 --> 17:25.605
You are Musashi Miyamoto, I believe?

17:26.284 --> 17:30.914
My name is Hayato Ooseto, I'm a
swordsman, traveling across the country.

17:31.790 --> 17:34.224
I would like to challenge you to a duel.

17:35.494 --> 17:38.190
Along with the man
who's hiding back there?

17:42.701 --> 17:46.193
I see you're not any
run-of-the-mill swordsmen!

17:50.775 --> 17:52.504
Are you Yagyu's retainers?

18:25.343 --> 18:29.712
So is that the best the
the Yagyu Shinkage Style has to offer?

18:30.649 --> 18:32.082
Not good enough for me.

18:32.817 --> 18:36.844
I suppose there's only
one man who can fire me up!

19:20.031 --> 19:20.793
Master!

19:21.032 --> 19:22.499
Great Master!

19:22.834 --> 19:23.926
Iori...

19:26.004 --> 19:28.370
For gosh sakes! I've
been waiting for you!

19:29.407 --> 19:34.140
I know you told me to wait at Kokura,
but I couldn't stand it anymore!

19:34.613 --> 19:37.013
Have you been following
me all this time?

19:37.115 --> 19:37.945
Well, yeah...

19:40.285 --> 19:41.479
Take me with you!

19:41.620 --> 19:44.646
Take me with you so I can
train as a swordsman too!

19:49.127 --> 19:50.253
Master?

19:52.597 --> 19:55.293
I'm hungry, let's go
get something to eat.

19:57.736 --> 19:59.567
Yes, sir, Master!

20:05.710 --> 20:08.474
What am I, a bird trapped in a cage?

20:08.913 --> 20:11.074
I understand how you must be feeling.

20:11.650 --> 20:13.914
But I must ask you to calm down.

20:14.152 --> 20:16.347
How in the world can I be calm?

20:16.955 --> 20:20.391
My uncle wants to send me off
to a strange land to be married...

20:20.659 --> 20:23.685
...he's trying to use
me as a political tool!

20:24.529 --> 20:29.193
That will never happen, as long
as I live, I shall never allow it...

20:29.734 --> 20:31.099
Never...

20:40.578 --> 20:43.877
Yakumo, what should I do?

20:53.425 --> 20:54.084
Jii!

20:54.893 --> 20:56.554
What's the matter, Jii?

20:57.495 --> 21:00.157
Oh, it's nothing, really...

21:01.066 --> 21:02.658
It's just the usual...

21:04.936 --> 21:05.630
Somebody!

21:05.770 --> 21:06.702
Somebody come!

21:07.372 --> 21:08.339
You called, Princess?

21:10.408 --> 21:12.968
Don't just stand there, you
have to get a doctor here!

21:13.111 --> 21:14.305
Yes, right away.

21:14.813 --> 21:16.610
You've got to hang on, Jii!

21:17.248 --> 21:18.180
Jii!

21:18.283 --> 21:21.275
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.430 --> 21:44.467
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.743 --> 21:54.482
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.619 --> 22:03.618
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.762 --> 22:14.434
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.473 --> 22:21.605
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:21.980 --> 22:24.972
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.850 --> 22:32.119
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.423 --> 22:37.918
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.911 --> 22:54.708
They say that in that instant...

22:54.813 --> 22:57.680
...the wind grows still and the only
sound you can hear is a roar of rage...

22:57.982 --> 23:01.076
Master of the sickle-and-chain, Baiken
Shishido is set to make his move.

23:01.419 --> 23:04.445
Next episode of the Age of Chaos,
"Blast of the Sickle-and-Chain."

23:04.589 --> 23:06.352
Pay close attention, and wait!
